  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Airlink Airlift Aid - Hurricane Fiona</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hurricane Fiona has heavily impacted communities across Puerto Rico, the Dominican Republic and Canada with heavy winds and rain creating flooding, mudslides, and significant damage to homes.  We are currently working with relief partners who are on the ground assessing critical needs and assisting our NGO partners by coordinating airlift for emergency responders.</narrative>
  </description>
